<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "システム音\The_Lampe.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>"Thank you for all your hard work, <VAR NAME="プレイヤー名" unk3="50">-sama. You have reached the sixth ending."<PG>
"We have come this far, and yet it is still hard to say that everything has become clear."<PG>
"New mysteries and secrets unfold, and we only sink deeper into the mire. That is likely because in this world, so many elements are tangled together in such complex ways."<PG>
"Unfortunately, this arc alone cannot solve every mystery."<PG>
"However, overall completion is still at <VAR NAME="全体進行率" unk3="50">%. What this means is―"
{PAUSE ""}
{}
<EVENT VALUE="NOREPAGE">
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
